0.16806722820527292,\"text\":\"to speak too fast.\",\"y\":0.12338917546772998,\"height\":0.013238731118821678,\"x\":0.13235294332033265},{\"width\":0.19537814265639558,\"text\":\"Slick Jack, however，\",\"y\":0.12338917541928052,\"height\":0.013238731118821567,\"x\":0.3130252111297855},{\"width\":0.0630252052442225,\"text\":\"（Henry\",\"y\":0.10889175236174264,\"height\":0.014654759279231433,\"x\":0.4432773125564602},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Cheung），the servant, was very competent\",\"y\":0.09593023306339976,\"height\":0.013081394520002565,\"x\":0.1344537884575033},{\"width\":0.0999675299225849,\"text\":\"in his role.\",\"y\":0.08258810739844413,\"height\":0.014723688056788475,\"x\":0.13177574451159682},{\"width\":0.025210082808723,\"text\":\"26\",\"y\":0.052190721823169306,\"height\":0.013216254637413383,\"x\":0.13025210145278135},{\"width\":0.3340336069922968,\"text\":\"This is a very suitable little play for\",\"y\":0.8704896908067048,\"height\":0.014819587628865927,\"x\":0.5945378143960086},{\"width\":0.3760503962677657,\"text\":\"young students. Although there is very lit-\",\"y\":0.8559922682977754,\"height\":0.014647266299454231,\"x\":0.550420183203652},{\"width\":0.25,\"text\":\"it the dialogue is good. St.\",\"y\":0.8414948455102609,\"height\":0.014609805701934153,\"x\":0.6764705851102942},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Michael was looking for the top of his\",\"y\":0.8269974224958623,\"height\":0.014572345104414075,\"x\":0.5525210153482597},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"spear and the Devil, his tail. They both\",\"y\":0.8124999998270492,\"height\":0.014534883892413197,\"x\":0.550420162036194},{\"width\":0.3760503962677656,\"text\":\"lost these when the stained glass window\",\"y\":0.7992912370555548,\"height\":0.014819587628865927,\"x\":0.5504201845341842},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"in which they stood, was smashed during\",\"y\":0.7834302325346905,\"height\":0.014572344489933275,\"x\":0.5504201684827726},{\"width\":0.37815124568601466,\"text\":\"the war. St. Michael, played by Hui On\",\"y\":0.7673969073310257,\"height\":0.016108247422680466,\"x\":0.5483193377137153},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Ting, had a difficult part as he had to speak\",\"y\":0.7543604654027704,\"height\":0.014647266299454231,\"x\":0.552521010533834},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"with an American accent. He did this very\",\"y\":0.741279070236365,\"height\":0.013231238753525276,\"x\":0.5525210153482597},{\"width\":0.37815124568601477,\"text\":\"competently. Chui Sai Man looked like a\",\"y\":0.7238372096632513,\"height\":0.01746433666071945,\"x\":0.5483193342473288},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"Devil and showed good acting ability.\",\"y\":0.7122093027581673,\"height\":0.013081394520002565,\"x\":0.5525210108334629},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Cheung Chi Keung spoke well and Chan\",\"y\":0.6976744190917429,\"height\":0.013081394520002565,\"x\":0.5525210144133857},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Kin Ming performed the part of an appre-\",\"y\":0.682989690522809,\"height\":0.013231239368006187,\"x\":0.5525210144133857},{\"width\":0.24369748018661164,\"text\":\"hensive wife convincingly.\",\"y\":0.6671511627776305,\"height\":0.014549868008525202,\"x\":0.5483193301798033},{\"width\":0.13690630654142155,\"text\":\"In general the\",\"y\":0.6663157517579766,\"height\":0.01620570531825416,\"x\":0.7897401233688511},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"diction was good and the result would have\",\"y\":0.6539948453777702,\"height\":0.013208762886598002,\"x\":0.5504201610960681},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"been better if the actors had managed to\",\"y\":0.6394974227598292,\"height\":0.013208762886597891,\"x\":0.5504201691843033},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"move around the stage more —not an\",\"y\":0.6249999999634539,\"height\":0.013208762886598002,\"x\":0.5504201638796815},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"easy thing to do when there is a lot of\",\"y\":0.6104651166208126,\"height\":0.013081394520002565,\"x\":0.550420162036194},{\"width\":0.2310924263391556,\"text\":\"Play The Old She-Dragon\",\"y\":0.5595930236266267,\"height\":0.013216254637413383,\"x\":0.5483193307379853},{\"width\":0.05672268543083425,\"text\":\"Cast：—\",\"y\":0.5347938145032178,\"height\":0.010309278350515427,\"x\":0.5504201689442468},{\"width\":0.061118738293536645,\"text\":\"General\",\"y\":0.5113426042418934,\"height\":0.010745023943714238,\"x\":0.5713313866492832},{\"width\":0.1155462131695778,\"text\":\"Prime-minister\",\"y\":0.49709302374970765,\"height\":0.011627906376553532,\"x\":0.5714285748227741},{\"width\":0.054621846678094776,\"text\":\"Robert\",\"y\":0.4825581395510834,\"height\":0.01017441823310461,\"x\":0.57142857287944},{\"width\":0.04221698444576205,\"text\":\"Peter\",\"y\":0.46924075723554326,\"height\":0.009192904553462555,\"x\":0.5713284832660825},{\"width\":0.0504798853608458,\"text\":\"Queen\",\"y\":0.4534172915141742,\"height\":0.010316579612260068,\"x\":0.5692978716057268},{\"width\":0.0651975917905041,\"text\":\"Michael\",\"y\":0.4402776343597965,\"height\":0.008979615169702138,\"x\":0.5692919595926034},{\"width\":0.09043440592144536,\"text\":\"（Form 2C）\",\"y\":0.534698676271168,\"height\":0.011997995917330084,\"x\":0.7793626277449223},{\"width\":0.13025209510426372,\"text\":\"： Liu Hon Por\",\"y\":0.5130813955782152,\"height\":0.010174418233104499,\"x\":0.7247899201369437},{\"width\":0.14705881934685905,\"text\":\"：Fong Nai Sing\",\"y\":0.4970930238882546,\"height\":0.013216254637413383,\"x\":0.724789918827971},{\"width\":0.13445377972008243,\"text\":\"Chan Hung Chi\",\"y\":0.48255813968963013,\"height\":0.011642891107146225,\"x\":0.7521008419151689},{\"width\":0.15546217435781684,\"text\":\"： Law Hong Ping\",\"y\":0.4664948452142528,\"height\":0.013208762886597891,\"x\":0.7247899237454611},{\"width\":0.1974789920746447,\"text\":\"： Cheung Hing Chuen，\",\"y\":0