01},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"control of the “She Dragon”， Queen\",\"y\":0.25726744215551844,\"height\":0.01598837203586223,\"x\":0.5504201736991},{\"width\":0.2626050396267765,\"text\":\"Hepzibah （Cheng Kat Hong）.\",\"y\":0.241279069995877,\"height\":0.01613072390408865,\"x\":0.5483193307380824},{\"width\":0.09873949603732235,\"text\":\"However it\",\"y\":0.24548969087761918,\"height\":0.011920103092783463,\"x\":0.8277310910832295},{\"width\":0.37439104206408724,\"text\":\"was a pity that he overacted at times. Liu\",\"y\":0.22716246603431467,\"height\":0.01780564576080168,\"x\":0.5501843510734494},{\"width\":0.37394957529087547,\"text\":\"Hon Por and Fong Nai Sing as General &\",\"y\":0.21359536098602228,\"height\":0.014602313336637862,\"x\":0.5504201698125456},{\"width\":0.3760503962677656,\"text\":\"Prime Minister played their parts very well.\",\"y\":0.20058139578747936,\"height\":0.013081394520002565,\"x\":0.5504201862848845},{\"width\":0.3760503962677656,\"text\":\"Peter （Law Hong Ping） gave the Prince the\",\"y\":0.1845930238814526,\"height\":0.014534882663451487,\"x\":0.5504201862848845},{\"width\":0.3764604353393669,\"text\":\"right ideas and acted very well indeed. He\",\"y\":0.1689237724157422,\"height\":0.018318160907509484,\"x\":0.5502144151986842},{\"width\":0.37815124568601466,\"text\":\"showed that he has acting ability. Wu Ting\",\"y\":0.15689432986567142,\"height\":0.013208762886598002,\"x\":0.5483193398670766},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"Yuk looked very much like a king, playing\",\"y\":0.14239690735674226,\"height\":0.013208762886597891,\"x\":0.5504201704973284},{\"width\":0.37815124568601466,\"text\":\"the part of Michael, who came to the\",\"y\":0.12645348839536308,\"height\":0.014654759279231433,\"x\":0.5483193398670766},{\"width\":0.2100840317014212,\"text\":\"rescue of the Prince.\",\"y\":0.1133720932196498,\"height\":0.013238731733302478,\"x\":0.5483193321184769},{\"width\":0.16806722820527287,\"text\":\"Queen Hepzibah\",\"y\":0.1133720932196498,\"height\":0.013238731733302478,\"x\":0.7563025215416213},{\"width\":0.37605042470912453,\"text\":\"could have been more domineering. It was\",\"y\":0.09883720980758592,\"height\":0.013081394520002454,\"x\":0.5504201704973284},{\"width\":0.10924369335618955,\"text\":\"a fine effort.\",\"y\":0.08569587656017463,\"height\":0.011687844069962594,\"x\":0.5504201714941741}]",
